    {
      "heading": "Counters (助数詞)",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "text",
          "paragraphs": [
            "Japanese needs a counter word after a number. The number + counter comes after the noun and its particle: りんごを みっつ かいました (I bought three apples). Sound changes happen at 1, 3, 6, 8, 10 with counters starting with h/k/s/t/p. Irregular readings are listed exactly as you must say them."
          ]
        },
